<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your disrupted journey from {!Case.Departure_City__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that on time departure is as much a priority for us as it is for you, and we work hard to ensure your flight departs and arrives as close to schedule as possible. While safety must always be our first priority, I certainly appreciate how inconvenient the delay was for you, and would like to apologise for the impact this had on your onward flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">When a flight is delayed our team should take all available measures to minimise the disruption and promptly rebook any onward connections on your ticket. I was concerned to hear about the error made by our team and the further delay this caused you.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If accommodated add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am glad the staff were able to arrange accommodation for you until the following day. If you need a letter outlining the circumstances of the delay, to assist you making a claim for any further unexpected expenses through your travel insurance policy, please let me know and I would be happy to provide you a letter.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If had to source own accommodation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We regret the unexpected expense you incurred while delayed overnight and would be happy to look at your <b><i>-accommodation/taxi/meal-</i></b><i>&nbsp;</i>costs. I have attached a form for you to provide your bank account details, so that we can process any refund. When returning the completed form and supporting documentation/receipts, please reply to this email to ensure the information is attached to your file for processing.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If a Frequent Flyer:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}&nbsp;Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If not a Frequent Flyer: -</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to arrange a credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}&nbsp;Qantas Points to you. You can use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email, so that we can credit points to your account. If you are not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can assure you that our airport management in <b><i>-AIRPORT WHERE ERROR OCCURRED-</i></b>&nbsp;are committed to improving our delay handling process when unforeseen issues occur, and first-hand experience like this is vital to developing our service. We are grateful you took the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><div><font size="2"><br></font></div><br></font><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>